{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/615801-necromancy-as-blood-sorcery","id":615801,"title":"Necromancy as Blood Sorcery","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-04T17:38:51-07:00","id":615801,"title":"Necromancy as Blood Sorcery","content":"Has anyone done a write up of necromancy using the blood sorcery rules,? Dynamic or not?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T00:40:59-07:00","id":616060,"title":"","content":"Back when the Blood sorcery book came out I did these: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/8627-requiem-homebrew-hub?p=18806#post18806\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...8806#post18806</a><br /> <br /> As well as a take on Kindred Vodoun: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1748-blood-and-smoke-bloodline-disciplines-conversions?p=25368#post25368\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...5368#post25368</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T04:45:53-07:00","id":616288,"title":"","content":"Personally, I took Theban and just slid a few rituals in it. Bone Path raises zombies, removes souls and raises revenants; that first one is already a Theban ritual, the last one is just an enhanced version of the first. Shadowlands don't quite exist anymore - its all in Twilight, so the Ash path has a few issues in translation. And ghosts use different rules as well. So, direct translation is out.<br /> <br /> Are you looking for 1e or 2e rituals? Because, depending on which, I have different sets for each edition on this matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T11:44:36-07:00","id":616730,"title":"","content":"I used the vampire translation guide to get the Cappadocian in Requiem. I turned them into a covenant and use necromancy Rite as the covenant's blood sorcery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T12:13:47-07:00","id":616736,"title":"","content":"I wrote us a crazy-long yet still kinda-bare-bones (no pun intended) sprawling set of rules for <b>Vampire: the Requiem</b> Necromancy that wasn't quite a proper Discipline nor anything like blood sorcery as we know it, but somewhere between a school of magic and a set of Devotions. It incorporated both aspects of ghostly manipulation and the notion of waking cadavers, built into a series of 'Branches' (divided into affecting spirits or flesh) and 'Destinations' within the Branches (dealing with effects upon oneself or on another). I never wound up <i>doing</i> much much beyond the basic schematic of how it worked, and then decided that Kindred - the default vampires in the World of Darkness - weren't the ideal vehicle for using those things.<br /> <br /> ...So no, I haven't done anything like what you're asking, but now you know that I've done something totally daft and far more complicated than it needed to be. I guess I just wasted your time. Sorry. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T17:19:40-08:00","id":833601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phaolan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/615801-necromancy-as-blood-sorcery?p=616736#post616736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote us a crazy-long yet still kinda-bare-bones (no pun intended) sprawling set of rules for <b>Vampire: the Requiem</b> Necromancy that wasn't quite a proper Discipline nor anything like blood sorcery as we know it, but somewhere between a school of magic and a set of Devotions. It incorporated both aspects of ghostly manipulation and the notion of waking cadavers, built into a series of 'Branches' (divided into affecting spirits or flesh) and 'Destinations' within the Branches (dealing with effects upon oneself or on another). I never wound up <i>doing</i> much much beyond the basic schematic of how it worked, and then decided that Kindred - the default vampires in the World of Darkness - weren't the ideal vehicle for using those things.<br /> <br /> ...So no, I haven't done anything like what you're asking, but now you know that I've done something totally daft and far more complicated than it needed to be. I guess I just wasted your time. Sorry. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>post a link","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T09:29:37-08:00","id":833876,"title":"","content":"I wrote up something a while ago. It's a static system (so you don't have the free-form rules from Blood and Sorcery), but it is built from the rules of Blood and Sorcery and Second Edition.<br /> <br /> Here's a <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6L8E16LmbsyVzlsblZvRHF6dFE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">link</a>, because formatting it all into the forum is a ball-ache.<br /> <br /> I'm not too sure of the homunculi rules, but I imagine they'll work. They're a project that I'd like to come back to some point, and do some undead servant stuff for Second Edition.<br /> <br /> Hope it's useful!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/417-the_duck","name":"the_duck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T15:17:43-08:00","id":834082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the_duck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/615801-necromancy-as-blood-sorcery?p=833876#post833876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote up something a while ago. It's a static system (so you don't have the free-form rules from Blood and Sorcery), but it is built from the rules of Blood and Sorcery and Second Edition.<br /> <br /> Here's a <a href=\"http://&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6L8E16LmbsyVzlsblZvRHF6dFE/view?usp=sharing&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">link</a>, because formatting it all into the forum is a ball-ache.<br /> <br /> I'm not too sure of the homunculi rules, but I imagine they'll work. They're a project that I'd like to come back to some point, and do some undead servant stuff for Second Edition.<br /> <br /> Hope it's useful!</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey I can't read your doc could you open the doc to sharing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10820-blakemikizuki","name":"Blakemikizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T03:08:35-08:00","id":834340,"title":"","content":"Had a massive durp moment... The doc should be available now &gt;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/417-the_duck","name":"the_duck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T15:25:37-08:00","id":836708,"title":"","content":"I wrote this to work along side the mechanical bloodline conversions I've been doing over time, but also for general use (generally, anyone can learn it if taught, but necromantic bloodlines can do it innately and get specific bonuses on it): <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ENK5kxk4R3BtfLbt_MZ5PtoDJpUF1kAb_9xf7ipYHcY/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Kindred Necromancy</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/bro